<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>kvm - 標籤 - Divazone's Space</title><link>https://blog.divazone.tw/tags/kvm/</link><description>kvm - 標籤 - Divazone's Space</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-TW</language><managingEditor>kingweirong@gmail.com (Divazone King)</managingEditor><webMaster>kingweirong@gmail.com (Divazone King)</webMaster><copyright>Divazone King</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.divazone.tw/tags/kvm/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>自定義 QCOW2 映像檔</title><link>https://blog.divazone.tw/2026/10/20261027-self-defined-qcow2.md/</link><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>Divazone King</author><guid>https://blog.divazone.tw/2026/10/20261027-self-defined-qcow2.md/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;code>virt-customize&lt;/code> 是 libguestfs 生態系的離線映像客製化工具，可安裝套件、修改設定與注入 SSH 公鑰。本文示範 QCOW2 格式；離線是指不啟動目標 VM，不代表安裝套件時不需要網路。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>